---
title: Complaint State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open : Retailer submits claim (shipment, line, batch, quantity, reason, evidence)
    Open --> Approved : Admin/Operator accepts claim
    Open --> Rejected : Admin/Operator rejects claim (reason required)
    Rejected --> Open : Retailer supplements evidence and resubmits
    Rejected --> Resolved : closed without resubmission
    Approved --> Replacement : outcome Replacement chosen
    Approved --> FinancialAdjustment : outcome FinancialAdjustment chosen
    state Replacement {
        [*] --> Preparing : designated warehouse prepares replacement batch
        Preparing --> Shipped : replacement batch issued (ReplacementIssue, stock decreases)
        Shipped --> Received : Retailer confirms replacement received
        Received --> [*]
    }
    Replacement --> Resolved : replacement completed
    FinancialAdjustment --> Resolved : receivable reduced or refund raised at final price (Loyalty adjusted)
    Resolved --> [*]
